{"code":"zh","name":"Chinese","native":"中文","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"B1","level":{"title":"Intermediate: 把/被, family, comparisons, weather","goals":["Handle objects with 把 and 被","Talk family with 的 and ages","Compare, opine and describe weather"],"units":[{"id":"B1-U1","title":"把 and 被","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U1-L1","title":"把: handle things!","learn":"把 GRABS objects! 把书放在桌子上 = Take the book, put it on the table. 把门关上 (close the door!), 把茶喝了 (drink up the tea!). Object JUMPS before the verb — with a result attached!","vocab":[{"t":"把","r":"bǎ","en":"take (disposal marker)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"放","r":"fàng","en":"to put","pos":"verb"},{"t":"拿","r":"ná","en":"to take / hold","pos":"verb"},{"t":"带","r":"dài","en":"to bring","pos":"verb"},{"t":"送","r":"sòng","en":"to give / send","pos":"verb"},{"t":"借","r":"jiè","en":"to borrow / lend","pos":"verb"},{"t":"还","r":"huán","en":"to return (thing)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"用","r":"yòng","en":"to use","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"把 + object + verb + result","explain":"把门关上 (close the door), 把作业写完 (finish homework), 把茶喝了 (drink the tea up). Verb needs a RESULT: 上/完/了/给…!","pattern":"把 + obj + verb + result","examples":[{"t":"把书放在桌子上。","r":"bǎ shū fàng zài zhuō zi shang.","en":"Put the book on the table."},{"t":"把门关上!","r":"bǎ mén guān shang!","en":"Close the door!"},{"t":"把茶喝了。","r":"bǎ chá hē le.","en":"Drink up the tea."}],"mistakes":["Saying 把书放 — verbs need RESULTS: 放在…上!","Using 把 for new info — 把 handles KNOWN things!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"把书放在桌子上!","r":"bǎ shū fàng zài zhuō zi shang!","en":"Put the book on the table!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"好! 把门关上吗?","r":"hǎo! bǎ mén guān shang ma?","en":"OK! Shall I close the door?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"关上吧!","r":"guān shang ba!","en":"Close it!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"好了!","r":"hǎo le!","en":"Done!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Close the door!","answer":"把门关上"},{"type":"fill","q":"把茶喝___。 (up)","answer":"了"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Put the book on the table' is…","options":["放书在桌子上","把书放在桌子上","书放在桌子上把","书把放桌子上"],"answer":"把书放在桌子上"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 关上 / 门 / 把","answer":"把门关上"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 把门关上!","answer":"把门关上!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"把 does what?","options":["negates","fronts known objects","asks","counts"],"answer":1,"why":"把 + object + verb-result."},{"q":"把-verbs need…","options":["nothing","a result (上/完/了)","吗","很"],"answer":1,"why":"关上、写完、喝了 — results!"},{"q":"把茶喝了 means…","options":["drink tea (habit)","drink up the tea","want tea","no tea"],"answer":1,"why":"把 + tea + drink-up."},{"q":"好了! means…","options":["goodbye","done!","sorry","maybe"],"answer":1,"why":"好了 = finished/ready!"},{"q":"借 means…","options":["return","borrow / lend","bring","use"],"answer":1,"why":"借 = borrow AND lend."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"把 worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["take (marker)","to put","to use"],"key":["把","放","用"]},{"instruction":"Handle things.","items":["Put the book on the table","Close the door!","Drink up the tea"],"key":["把书放在桌子上","把门关上","把茶喝了"]},{"instruction":"Order around.","items":["Close it!","Done!"],"key":["关上吧","好了"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U1-L2","title":"被: passive + 是…的","learn":"Bad things HAPPEN with 被! 我的杯子被打破了 (my cup got broken). 是…的 stresses HOW/WHEN: 我是昨天来的 (it was YESTERDAY I came). Passive pain + emphasis power!","vocab":[{"t":"被","r":"bèi","en":"by (passive)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"打破","r":"dǎ pò","en":"to break","pos":"verb"},{"t":"偷","r":"tōu","en":"to steal","pos":"verb"},{"t":"淋","r":"lín","en":"to drench","pos":"verb"},{"t":"批评","r":"pī píng","en":"to criticize","pos":"verb"},{"t":"表扬","r":"biǎo yáng","en":"to praise","pos":"verb"},{"t":"让","r":"ràng","en":"to let / by","pos":"verb"},{"t":"是…的","r":"shì…de","en":"it is…that","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"被 + doer + verb · 是…的","explain":"杯子被打破了 (cup got broken), 我被雨淋了 (I got rained on). 是…的: 我是坐车来的 (I came BY CAR — stress!).","pattern":"X 被 (doer) verb了 · 是 + detail + 的","examples":[{"t":"我的杯子被打破了。","r":"wǒ de bēi zi bèi dǎ pò le.","en":"My cup got broken."},{"t":"我被雨淋了!","r":"wǒ bèi yǔ lín le!","en":"I got soaked by rain!"},{"t":"我是昨天来的。","r":"wǒ shì zuó tiān lái de.","en":"It was yesterday I came."}],"mistakes":["Saying 被 for happy things — 被 loves BAD news!","Forgetting 的: 是…的 needs BOTH!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小明","t":"我的杯子被打破了!","r":"wǒ de bēi zi bèi dǎ pò le!","en":"My cup got broken!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"谁打破的?","r":"shéi dǎ pò de?","en":"Who broke it?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"是猫打破的!","r":"shì māo dǎ pò de!","en":"It was the CAT that broke it!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"可怜的杯子!","r":"kě lián de bēi zi!","en":"Poor cup!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: My cup got broken","answer":"我的杯子被打破了"},{"type":"fill","q":"我是昨天___的。 (came)","answer":"来"},{"type":"choose","q":"'It was the cat that broke it' is…","options":["猫打破了杯子","是猫打破的","猫被打破的","是打破猫的"],"answer":"是猫打破的"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 打破了 / 被 / 杯子","answer":"杯子被打破了"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我的杯子被打破了!","answer":"我的杯子被打破了!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"被 is for…","options":["happy news","unhappy events","questions","commands"],"answer":1,"why":"被 = got-broken/soaked!"},{"q":"我是昨天来的 stresses…","options":["I","yesterday","came","all"],"answer":1,"why":"是…的 stresses the middle."},{"q":"是…的 needs…","options":["是 only","both 是 and 的","的 only","neither"],"answer":1,"why":"是…的 — a pair!"},{"q":"打破 means…","options":["to break","to fix","to buy","to sell"],"answer":0,"why":"打破 = break."},{"q":"可怜 means…","options":["happy","poor / pitiful","angry","lucky"],"answer":1,"why":"可怜 = pitiful."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"被 worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["by (passive)","to break","it is…that"],"key":["被","打破","是…的"]},{"instruction":"Passive + emphasis.","items":["My cup got broken","I got soaked by rain","It was yesterday I came"],"key":["我的杯子被打破了","我被雨淋了","我是昨天来的"]},{"instruction":"Blame.","items":["Who broke it?","Poor cup!"],"key":["谁打破的","可怜的杯子"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U2","title":"Family and age","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U2-L1","title":"Family: 家","learn":"Family! 爸爸 (dad), 妈妈 (mum), 哥哥 (older brother), 姐姐 (older sister), 弟弟/妹妹 (younger). Age-ranked! 的 = 's: 我的妈妈 (my mum), 他的爸爸 (his dad)!","vocab":[{"t":"家","r":"jiā","en":"family / home","pos":"noun"},{"t":"爸爸","r":"bà ba","en":"dad","pos":"noun"},{"t":"妈妈","r":"mā ma","en":"mum","pos":"noun"},{"t":"兄弟","r":"xiōng dì","en":"brothers","pos":"noun"},{"t":"姐妹","r":"jiě mèi","en":"sisters","pos":"noun"},{"t":"儿子","r":"ér zi","en":"son","pos":"noun"},{"t":"女儿","r":"nǚ ér","en":"daughter","pos":"noun"},{"t":"父母","r":"fù mǔ","en":"parents","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"的 possession + sibling ranks","explain":"我的书 (my book), 他的妈妈 (his mum). Siblings: 哥哥/弟弟 (older/younger brother), 姐姐/妹妹 (older/younger sister) — age matters!","pattern":"X + 的 + thing · 哥哥/弟弟","examples":[{"t":"我爸爸是老师。","r":"wǒ bà ba shì lǎo shī.","en":"My dad is a teacher."},{"t":"你妈妈呢?","r":"nǐ mā ma ne?","en":"And your mum?"},{"t":"我家有四口人。","r":"wǒ jiā yǒu sì kǒu rén.","en":"My family has four people."}],"mistakes":["Saying 我的爸爸 always — close family drops 的: 我爸爸!","Calling older brother 弟弟 — older: 哥哥!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"你家有几口人?","r":"nǐ jiā yǒu jǐ kǒu rén?","en":"How many in your family?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"四口人。爸爸、妈妈和我。","r":"sì kǒu rén. bà ba, mā ma hé wǒ.","en":"Four. Dad, mum and me (and one more)!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"你有兄弟吗?","r":"nǐ yǒu xiōng dì ma?","en":"Do you have brothers?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"有，我有一个哥哥!","r":"yǒu, wǒ yǒu yí ge gē ge!","en":"Yes, I have an older brother!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: My dad is a teacher","answer":"我爸爸是老师"},{"type":"fill","q":"___妈妈呢? (Your)","answer":"你"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How many in your family?' is…","options":["你家是什么","你家有几口人","你家在哪里","你家是谁"],"answer":"你家有几口人"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 是老师 / 我爸爸","answer":"我爸爸是老师"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我爸爸是老师。","answer":"我爸爸是老师。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"哥哥 is…","options":["younger brother","older brother","sister","cousin"],"answer":1,"why":"哥 = older brother."},{"q":"我爸爸 drops 的 because…","options":["plural","close family","formal","past"],"answer":1,"why":"Close relations skip 的."},{"q":"父母 means…","options":["brothers","parents","children","family"],"answer":1,"why":"父母 = parents."},{"q":"女儿 means…","options":["son","daughter","sister","mother"],"answer":1,"why":"女儿 = daughter."},{"q":"口 counts…","options":["things","family members","books","days"],"answer":1,"why":"四口人 = four mouths/people."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Family worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["family","dad","daughter"],"key":["家","爸爸","女儿"]},{"instruction":"Family talk.","items":["My dad is a teacher","And your mum?"],"key":["我爸爸是老师","你妈妈呢"]},{"instruction":"Count family.","items":["How many in your family?","Four people"],"key":["你家有几口人","四口人"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U2-L2","title":"Age: 几岁/多大","learn":"Age TWO ways! 几岁? (how many years — kids), 多大? (how big — adults, polite!). 我二十岁 (I'm 20). Birthdays: 生日是什么时候? → 三月! Months: 月, days: 号!","vocab":[{"t":"几岁","r":"jǐ suì","en":"how old (kids)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"多大","r":"duō dà","en":"how old (adults)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"二十岁","r":"èr shí suì","en":"20 years old","pos":"noun"},{"t":"生日","r":"shēng rì","en":"birthday","pos":"noun"},{"t":"什么时候","r":"shén me shí hou","en":"when","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"每年","r":"měi nián","en":"every year","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"祝贺","r":"zhù hè","en":"congratulations","pos":"verb"},{"t":"蛋糕","r":"dàn gāo","en":"cake","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"几岁/多大 · 月/号 dates","explain":"你几岁? (kids), 你多大? (adults). Months: 一月 (Jan), 三月 (Mar). Days: 三号 (3rd), 二十号 (20th)!","pattern":"岁 (age) · 月 (month) · 号 (day)","examples":[{"t":"我二十岁。","r":"wǒ èr shí suì.","en":"I'm twenty."},{"t":"我的生日是三月。","r":"wǒ de shēng rì shì sān yuè.","en":"My birthday is March."},{"t":"生日快乐!","r":"shēng rì kuài lè!","en":"Happy birthday!"}],"mistakes":["Asking elders 几岁 — adults: 多大!","Saying 三天 for March 3rd — days: 三号!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小明","t":"你多大?","r":"nǐ duō dà?","en":"How old are you?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"我二十岁!","r":"wǒ èr shí suì!","en":"I'm twenty!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"你的生日是什么时候?","r":"nǐ de shēng rì shì shén me shí hou?","en":"When is your birthday?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"三月!","r":"sān yuè!","en":"March!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I'm twenty","answer":"我二十岁"},{"type":"fill","q":"我的生日是___。 (March)","answer":"三月"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Happy birthday!' is…","options":["新年快乐","生日快乐","祝贺新年","辛苦了"],"answer":"生日快乐"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 二十岁 / 我","answer":"我二十岁"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我二十岁。","answer":"我二十岁。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"多大 asks age of…","options":["kids","adults","babies","nobody"],"answer":1,"why":"多大 = polite adult ask."},{"q":"几岁 asks age of…","options":["adults","kids","elders","all"],"answer":1,"why":"几岁 = for children."},{"q":"三月 means…","options":["March","3 days","3 years","May"],"answer":0,"why":"三 + 月 = March."},{"q":"生日 means…","options":["age","birthday","year","party"],"answer":1,"why":"生日 = birthday."},{"q":"什么时候 means…","options":["where","when","who","how"],"answer":1,"why":"什么时候 = when."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Age worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["how old (adults)","birthday","cake"],"key":["多大","生日","蛋糕"]},{"instruction":"Ages and dates.","items":["I'm twenty","My birthday is March","Happy birthday!"],"key":["我二十岁","我的生日是三月","生日快乐"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["How old are you?","When is your birthday?"],"key":["你多大","你的生日是什么时候"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U3","title":"Opinions and weather","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U3-L1","title":"Opinions: 我觉得 + 比","learn":"Opine! 我觉得… (I feel that…): 我觉得地铁很好! Compare with 比: 北京比上海大 (Beijing is bigger than Shanghai). 更 (even more), 最 (most): 最好 = best!","vocab":[{"t":"觉得","r":"jué de","en":"to feel / think","pos":"verb"},{"t":"认为","r":"rèn wéi","en":"to believe","pos":"verb"},{"t":"好","r":"hǎo","en":"good","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"坏","r":"huài","en":"bad","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"更","r":"gèng","en":"even more","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"最","r":"zuì","en":"most","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"意见","r":"yì jiàn","en":"opinion","pos":"noun"},{"t":"同意","r":"tóng yì","en":"to agree","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"我觉得… + A比B + adj","explain":"我觉得地铁很好 (I think the subway is good). 北京比上海大 (Beijing is bigger than Shanghai). 更大 (even bigger), 最好 (best)!","pattern":"觉得… · A 比 B + adj · 更/最","examples":[{"t":"我觉得地铁很好。","r":"wǒ jué de dì tiě hěn hǎo.","en":"I think the subway is good."},{"t":"北京比上海大。","r":"Běi jīng bǐ Shàng hǎi dà.","en":"Beijing is bigger than Shanghai."},{"t":"这个最好!","r":"zhè ge zuì hǎo!","en":"This is the best!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 比北京上海大 — order: A比B: 北京比上海大!","Saying 最很好 — 最 replaces 很: 最好!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"我觉得地铁很好。","r":"wǒ jué de dì tiě hěn hǎo.","en":"I think the subway is good."},{"sp":"小明","t":"我觉得汽车很快。","r":"wǒ jué de qì chē hěn kuài.","en":"I think the car is fast."},{"sp":"小红","t":"但是地铁更便宜!","r":"dàn shì dì tiě gèng pián yi!","en":"But the subway is cheaper!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"同意!","r":"tóng yì!","en":"Agreed!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think the subway is good","answer":"我觉得地铁很好"},{"type":"fill","q":"这个___好! (most)","answer":"最"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Beijing is bigger than Shanghai' is…","options":["北京上海更大","北京比上海大","北京最大上海","比北京上海大"],"answer":"北京比上海大"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 地铁很好 / 我觉得","answer":"我觉得地铁很好"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我觉得地铁很好。","answer":"我觉得地铁很好。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"我觉得 means…","options":["I know","I think/feel","I see","I want"],"answer":1,"why":"觉得 = feel/think."},{"q":"北京比上海大 orders…","options":["B-比-A","A-比-B","比-A-B","A-B-比"],"answer":1,"why":"A 比 B + adj."},{"q":"更 means…","options":["most","even more","best","less"],"answer":1,"why":"更 = even-more."},{"q":"坏 means…","options":["good","bad","big","small"],"answer":1,"why":"坏 = bad."},{"q":"同意 means…","options":["disagree","agree","maybe","never"],"answer":1,"why":"同意 = agree."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Opinions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["to think","even more","opinion"],"key":["觉得","更","意见"]},{"instruction":"Think and compare.","items":["I think the subway is good","Beijing is bigger than Shanghai","This is the best"],"key":["我觉得地铁很好","北京比上海大","这个最好"]},{"instruction":"Debate.","items":["But the subway is cheaper!","Agreed!"],"key":["但是地铁更便宜","同意"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U3-L2","title":"Weather: 天气","learn":"Weather! 天气怎么样? (How's the weather?) → 很冷 (It's cold). 下雨 (it rains), 下雪 (it snows). Degree: 太冷了 (too cold!), 冷极了 (extremely cold)!","vocab":[{"t":"天气","r":"tiān qì","en":"weather","pos":"noun"},{"t":"太阳","r":"tài yang","en":"sun","pos":"noun"},{"t":"雨","r":"yǔ","en":"rain","pos":"noun"},{"t":"雪","r":"xuě","en":"snow","pos":"noun"},{"t":"冷","r":"lěng","en":"cold","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"热","r":"rè","en":"hot","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"暖和","r":"nuǎn huo","en":"warm","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"风","r":"fēng","en":"wind","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"下雨/下雪 · 太…了","explain":"下雨了 (it's raining — rain falls!), 下雪了 (it's snowing). 太冷了 (too cold), 很暖和 (very warm). 明天很暖和 (tomorrow is warm)!","pattern":"下 + 雨/雪 · 太 adj 了","examples":[{"t":"今天很冷。","r":"jīn tiān hěn lěng.","en":"Today is cold."},{"t":"下雨了。","r":"xià yǔ le.","en":"It's raining."},{"t":"昨天很冷。","r":"zuó tiān hěn lěng.","en":"Yesterday was cold."}],"mistakes":["Saying 雨下 — order: 下雨 (fall-rain)!","Saying 冷 for weather-cold-feeling — feeling-cold: 我觉得冷!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小明","t":"天气怎么样?","r":"tiān qì zěn me yàng?","en":"How is the weather?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"很冷! 下雪了!","r":"hěn lěng! xià xuě le!","en":"It's cold! It's snowing!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"明天暖和吗?","r":"míng tiān nuǎn huo ma?","en":"Will it be warm tomorrow?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"暖和! 去散步吧!","r":"nuǎn huo! qù sàn bù ba!","en":"Warm! Let's take a walk!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: It's raining","answer":"下雨了"},{"type":"fill","q":"今天很___。 (cold)","answer":"冷"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How is the weather?' is…","options":["天气是什么","天气怎么样","天气在哪里","天气什么时候"],"answer":"天气怎么样"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 了 / 下雨","answer":"下雨了"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 很冷! 下雪了!","answer":"很冷! 下雪了!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"下雨了 means…","options":["it snows","it's raining","it's windy","it's sunny"],"answer":1,"why":"下 + 雨 = rain-falls."},{"q":"太冷了 means…","options":["very warm","too cold","a little cold","not cold"],"answer":1,"why":"太…了 = too!"},{"q":"明天很暖和 means…","options":["today warm","tomorrow warm","yesterday warm","always warm"],"answer":1,"why":"明天 = tomorrow."},{"q":"下雪了 means…","options":["it rains","it snows","it winds","it hails"],"answer":1,"why":"下 + 雪 = snow-falls."},{"q":"雪 means…","options":["rain","snow","wind","sun"],"answer":1,"why":"雪 = snow."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Weather worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["weather","snow","cold"],"key":["天气","雪","冷"]},{"instruction":"Report weather.","items":["It's raining","Today is cold","Yesterday was cold"],"key":["下雨了","今天很冷","昨天很冷"]},{"instruction":"Ask and plan.","items":["How is the weather?","Let's take a walk!"],"key":["天气怎么样","去散步吧"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"B1 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Close the door!","answer":"把门关上"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: My cup got broken","answer":"我的杯子被打破了"},{"type":"choose","q":"'My dad is a teacher'","options":["我的爸爸是老师","我爸爸是老师","我爸爸是老师的","爸爸我是老师"],"answer":"我爸爸是老师"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"很冷! 下雪了!","answer":"It's cold! It's snowing!"},{"type":"fill","q":"我是昨天___的。 (came)","answer":"来"},{"type":"choose","q":"'It was the cat that broke it'","options":["猫打破了杯子","是猫打破的","猫被打破的","是打破猫的"],"answer":"是猫打破的"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 了 / 下雨","answer":"下雨了"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我觉得地铁很好。","answer":"我觉得地铁很好。"},{"type":"fill","q":"这个___好! (most)","answer":"最"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think the subway is good","answer":"我觉得地铁很好"}]}}}